<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.55% (Discount)	  O/N = 2.55% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.55%			 T/N = 2.55% (Discount)</p>
<p>		   Dec  5, 1996			Dec  4, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.10%	1 month forward =  5.09%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.46%	2 month forward =  6.62%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.80%	3 month forward =  6.79%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.48%	4 month forward =  7.56%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.82%	5 month forward =  7.88%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.60%	6 month forward =  7.87%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
